silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_01_three_axes_unpacked_concrete_anchor_2#layeraxis_classification silm:hasLongDescription "The LayerAxis_classification is the classification pole of the layer axis: \"Mittens is a DomesticCat\" -- typing-an-individual operation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'LayerAxis_classification', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
